0f6dc-950b-41ac-9550-ec1bfcb9a1d9","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"素で生れても、の意味でね","ts":"1624680834.484400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KL+T"}]},{"client_msg_id":"88e70465-8943-42d6-b8bb-04972db5a11f","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"まー、青とかはないけど、グレー系とか薄い茶とかあるから、そのへんのための言い訳が元だったりするかもね","ts":"1624680816.484000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZQqp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2ab0b41c-31be-441f-81c6-9b82437269ad","type":"message","user":"U76GA7MFA","text":"外国人の血が入っていることを隠すための方便みたいなのを想像してしまった。","ts":"1624680707.483300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=DT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c5df961d-11ac-49c0-938d-4ec8f8064cea","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"\u003chttps://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%82%A2%E3%83%AF%E3%83%93\u003e\n\u0026gt; 希に、春先のアワビ類の中腸腺の摂食により、光過敏症の中毒症状を発症することがある[4]。これは、アワビの餌である海藻のクロロフィルに由来するピロフェオホルバイドaとクロロフィルaによる物であるが、季節性を持つ蓄積の理由は明らかになっていない。この光過敏症に関しては、東北地方には「春先のアワビの内臓を食べさせるとネコの耳が落ちる」という言い伝えがある。\n実は化け猫チェックだったりして","ts":"1624680366.482600","attachments":[{"fallback":"wikipedia: アワビ","id":1,"author_name":"Wikipedia","author_link":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/","title":"アワビ","title_link":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%82%A2%E3%83%AF%E3%83%93","text":"アワビ（鮑、鰒、蚫、英語: abalone [æbəˈləʊni]）は、ミミガイ科の大型の巻貝の総称。アワビ属についてはHaliotisではなくてNordotisとしている図鑑もある。雌雄の判別は外見からではほぼ不可能で、肝ではなく生殖腺の色で見分ける。生殖腺が緑のものがメス で、白っぽいものがオスである。","image_url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5f/Awabi_03.JPG/1200px-Awabi_03.JPG","blocks":null,"service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/wikipedia.png","from_url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%82%A2%E3%83%AF%E3%83%93","original_url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%82%A2%E3%83%AF%E3%83%93"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"oho-","count":1,"users":["U843L486L"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ARI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e22e6b0f-8155-422b-8291-89974325c691","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"目に真珠層が生成されたら、つよそうだ","ts":"1624680172.482200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3wE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"145DC77E-A0C3-48DF-AC8C-48293720F650","type":"message","user":"U843L486L","text":"実家は海の幸の里なんですけど、鮑の肝を妊婦さんが食べると目が綺麗な子どもが産まれるといういい伝えがあったりします。","ts":"1624679902.481900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"AJni"}]},{"client_msg_id":"940D3A02-C3FF-435A-B472-520A829776C8","type":"message","user":"U843L486L","text":"旅館のコース料理だと、うまく取れなくてサザエを食べる事から離脱されてしまうこともあるので、いい作戦です。","ts":"1624679663.477600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"re6t"}]},{"client_msg_id":"22c00102-c747-43e7-b27e-ebcd97752b32","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"料理として出るときは、わりとありますね、苦いのだめな人もまあまあ助かる(切れてるから)","ts":"1624679515.474500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PQ0FF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2390E882-69B2-4949-B07F-32962EC03368","type":"message","user":"U843L486L","text":"サザエはカットされて焼かれてますね。\n楊枝でクルっと取る時に「尻尾の肝部分が千切れないかハラハラゲーム」をしなくて :benrisou: ですね。","ts":"1624679436.474000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hAQ7"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U76GA7MFA","text":"サザエをつぼ焼きにしたの。","ts":"1624679115.470200","files":[{"id":"F0269RDNH99","created":1624679107,"timestamp":1624679107,"name":"サザエ.jpg","title":"サザエ.jpg","mimetype":"image/jpeg","image_exif_rotation":0,"filetype":"jpg","pretty_type":"JPEG","user":"U76GA7MFA","mode":"hosted","editable":false,"is_external":false,"external_type":"","size":1287610,"url":"","url_download":"","ur